{"4663730":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"How Empires Work","steam_appid":4663730,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4782540],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/fc1f32c8d3fcbc9f53c327281b655c55.poster.avif?t=1793719122\" width=1138 height=302 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/fc1f32c8d3fcbc9f53c327281b655c55.webm?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/fc1f32c8d3fcbc9f53c327281b655c55.mp4?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Empress Demands your support<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empires are systems of power, and Her Imperial Majesty has entrusted you to with building one. Do not disappoint her.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/689efb06e96935ddc9ed7b0a3570ab9c.webp?t=1793719122\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/689efb06e96935ddc9ed7b0a3570ab9c.poster.avif?t=1793719122\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"A display of Money, increasing at an accelerating rate into the millions.\" width=500 height=200 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental Grand Strategy<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In How Empires Work you manage the development of a state, from local lordships to enormous networks of trade and conquest. Discover systems of taxation, trade, colonization, labour and more. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your state grows, unlock automation features that turn repeated actions into complex interlocking institutions. Build the economic and political machinery of empire, then employ your aristocracy to manage the bureaucracy that keeps it running.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/b05d166c059ae0aa7223b7ef00dafb15.poster.avif?t=1793719122\" aria-label=\"The mouse cursor hovering over a little forest, each tree popping and spraying leaves as it moves over them.\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/b05d166c059ae0aa7223b7ef00dafb15.webm?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/b05d166c059ae0aa7223b7ef00dafb15.mp4?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A beautiful world, yearning for your enlightened rule<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and expand across a hand-painted world that comes alive with flows of capital, commodities, and armies. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ both diplomatic influence and conquest to bring new lands into your imperial system.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/42e9d0000c4e9f84a7310120f64d9021.poster.avif?t=1793719122\" aria-label=\"A region of the world being gradually revealed, going from a map-like brown fog of war to a bright and colourful landscape.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/42e9d0000c4e9f84a7310120f64d9021.webm?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/42e9d0000c4e9f84a7310120f64d9021.mp4?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover systems and master history<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your empire develops the game changes around you, and new approaches are required to stand the test of history. You will have to deal with internal troubles, rival powers, and - regrettably - the French. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your economy, expand your influence, and watch your decisions compound into a grand imperial structure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/e1cacff78bcf4689f2da7c6d7d133b8e.poster.avif?t=1793719122\" aria-label=\"Tax delivery journeys making their way across the map towards the player&#039;s capital.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/e1cacff78bcf4689f2da7c6d7d133b8e.webm?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/e1cacff78bcf4689f2da7c6d7d133b8e.mp4?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/1cadb3fa361d410120ddaa19a9ed7706.poster.avif?t=1793719122\" aria-label=\"Cities across a landscape slowly catching on fire.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/1cadb3fa361d410120ddaa19a9ed7706.webm?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/1cadb3fa361d410120ddaa19a9ed7706.mp4?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you master the game you might even learn How Empires Work!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/6f64df7668ac09980b88c87eaf5dd446.poster.avif?t=1793719122\" width=1138 height=296 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/6f64df7668ac09980b88c87eaf5dd446.webm?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/6f64df7668ac09980b88c87eaf5dd446.mp4?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incremental Grand Strategy: Start with the humble click of a button and expand into the management of an Early Modern state of tax collectors, traders, armies, colonies and bureaucrats!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new regions, build roads, manage provinces, and project influence far and wide.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your economic engine and let it propel you into new eras along the long arc of history!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean on your aristocracy and growing bureaucracy to create the systems that sustain expansion!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn profit into power, and power into profit - just like real life!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive firm, helpful and always perfectly reasonable guidance from Her Imperial Majesty!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/9f5d60d4c1b8897a90c0b4b69bd105ec.poster.avif?t=1793719122\" aria-label=\"The Empress, menacingly waving her fan.\" width=1026 height=1490 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/9f5d60d4c1b8897a90c0b4b69bd105ec.webm?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/9f5d60d4c1b8897a90c0b4b69bd105ec.mp4?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/fc1f32c8d3fcbc9f53c327281b655c55.poster.avif?t=1793719122\" width=1138 height=302 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/fc1f32c8d3fcbc9f53c327281b655c55.webm?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/fc1f32c8d3fcbc9f53c327281b655c55.mp4?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stron