apps\/4663730\/extras\/6f64df7668ac09980b88c87eaf5dd446.poster.avif?t=1793719122\" width=1138 height=296 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/6f64df7668ac09980b88c87eaf5dd446.webm?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/6f64df7668ac09980b88c87eaf5dd446.mp4?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incremental Grand Strategy: Start with the humble click of a button and expand into the management of an Early Modern state of tax collectors, traders, armies, colonies and bureaucrats!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new regions, build roads, manage provinces, and project influence far and wide.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your economic engine and let it propel you into new eras along the long arc of history!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean on your aristocracy and growing bureaucracy to create the systems that sustain expansion!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn profit into power, and power into profit - just like real life!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive firm, helpful and always perfectly reasonable guidance from Her Imperial Majesty!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/9f5d60d4c1b8897a90c0b4b69bd105ec.poster.avif?t=1793719122\" aria-label=\"The Empress, menacingly waving her fan.\" width=1026 height=1490 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4663730\/extras\/9f5d60d4c1b8897a90c0b4b69bd105ec.webm?t=1793719122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sourc